					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411130904
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲謝爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 411130904,
					"content": "那些愚人眾，難道是衝著元素力來的？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411130905
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 411130905,
					"content": "不無可能。如果是這樣，其他生物也會想要這股力量才對。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411130906
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 411130906,
					"content": "我們靠近看看吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": []
				}
